<title>FINLAND: Instru Jan-April profit falls 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Instru Jan-April profit falls 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax	97 vs 110</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.37 vs 3.72</p>
<p> Net sales					    796 vs 745</p>
<p> Operating profit				    85 vs 80</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of eight analysts' forecasts for Finnish health care equipment maker Instrumentarium Oy profit before extras, tax had been 116 million in a 73-130 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 406 vs 372</p>
<p> Net financial items			  gain 12 vs 29 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	   97 vs 110</p>
<p> Taxes						   29 vs 35</p>
<p> Net profit					    68 vs 75</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		73 vs 68</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Instrumentarium Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
</text>
